{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep this potentially retrying status lookup off the callback-discovery path. A callback sent in the completed round can resume the workflow and create another short-timeout callback; if a different send populated `closed_callback_errors`, latency or retries here prevent discovering that callback until it expires. Reconcile saved rejections from subsequent/final history, or strictly bound the probe so it cannot delay polling, and test callback creation during a delayed status lookup.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABAiTgIg","finding_digest":"ada617b01cdc9bf17fe56f1305196788e9c344009fdc6a3e93a2873f3fb19234","finding_id":"arf_v1_vwtbpma43sn7c77fn4jqkglhrd","finding_key":"validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::blocking-status-preflight","identity_key":"validate.py::pollingvalidator.validate::blocking-status-preflight","line":829,"observation_digest":"e079832a1930c2b2a5bc0352b98bd051a5ee8c016a0cb98ee221ee76d99a5e16","observation_id":"aro_v1_4b4ygkqzgdblfjn4anjltc6qkg","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/validate.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_vwtbpma43sn7c77fn4jqkglhrd","published_at":"2026-10-20T22:18:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_n73y6qhikma54sens5yi3qu2u5","reviewed_base_sha":"37656dd6f43d565d8e90e22f3554faa7c92dcb01","reviewed_head_sha":"1c3b8b3f41f6fcd00f4414f630029510fac9e0d7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":829,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":142},"record_id":"art_v1_4on3dwb2ul276yt6pbjq7dkauo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-20T22:18:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
